                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 50:1",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 50,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "And upon the top of these ridges of earth he caused that there should be timbers, yea, works of timbers built up to the height of a man, round about the cities.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 73,
            "end": 80,
            "text": "Alma 53:4."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Alma 53:4.",
            "prettyString": "Alma 53:4",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "alma",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 53,
                    "end": 53,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 4,
                        "end": 4
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 50:2",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 50,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "And he caused that upon those works of timbers there should be a frame of pickets built upon the timbers round about; and they were strong and high.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 50:3",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 50,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "And he caused towers to be erected that overlooked those works of pickets, and he caused places of security to be built upon those towers, that the stones and the arrows of the Lamanites could not hurt them.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 131,
            "end": 137,
            "text": "2 Chr. 14:7 (7–8)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 50:4",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 50,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "And they were prepared that they could cast stones from the top thereof, according to their pleasure and their strength, and slay him who should attempt to approach near the walls of the city.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 50:5",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 50,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "Thus Moroni did prepare strongholds against the coming of their enemies, round about every city in all the land.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 50:6",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 50,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that Moroni caused that his armies should go forth into the east wilderness; yea, and they went forth and drove all the Lamanites who were in the east wilderness into their own lands, which were south of the land of Zarahemla.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 215,
            "end": 220,
            "text": "Alma 22:32."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Alma 22:32.",
            "prettyString": "Alma 22:32",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "alma",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 22,
                    "end": 22,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 32,
                        "end": 32
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 50:7",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 50,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And the land of Nephi did run in a straight course from the east sea to the west.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "2 Ne. 5:8; Omni 1:12 (12, 27); Mosiah 7:6 (6–7); 9:1 (1, 3–4, 14)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 50:8",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 50,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that when Moroni had driven all the Lamanites out of the east wilderness, which was north of the lands of their own possessions, he caused that the inhabitants who were in the land of Zarahemla and in the land round about should go forth into the east wilderness, even to the borders by the seashore, and possess the land.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 50:9",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 50,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And he also placed armies on the south, in the borders of their possessions, and caused them to erect fortifications that they might secure their armies and their people from the hands of their enemies.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 102,
            "end": 116,
            "text": "Alma 49:13 (13, 18–24); 53:3 (3–7)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 50:10",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 50,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And thus he cut off all the strongholds of the Lamanites in the east wilderness, yea, and also on the west, fortifying the line between the Nephites and the Lamanites, between the land of Zarahemla and the land of Nephi, from the west sea, running by the head of the river Sidon—the Nephites possessing all the land northward, yea, even all the land which was northward of the land Bountiful, according to their pleasure.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 267,
            "end": 278,
            "text": "Alma 2:15; 22:29."
          },
          {
            "start": 316,
            "end": 325,
            "text": "Morm. 2:3."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Alma 2:15; 22:29.",
            "prettyString": "Alma 2:15; 22:29",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "alma",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 2,
